WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.023 --> 00:00:14.464
woman was a demon!"

2
00:00:14.685 --> 00:00:15.605
cried Wukong.

3
00:00:15.625 --> 00:00:18.067
"And she kidnapped the Tang Monk!"

4
00:00:19.508 --> 00:00:22.910
He leaped into the air, and Bajie and Wujing followed.

5
00:00:24.191 --> 00:00:28.254
In the distance the monkey saw a dark cloud speeding toward a mountain.

6
00:00:28.274 --> 00:00:31.376
"That must be her," said Wukong.

7
00:00:32.300 --> 00:00:33.841
"Quickly!" said Wujing.

8
00:00:34.441 --> 00:00:35.441
"We must catch her!"

9
00:00:37.542 --> 00:00:41.604
They raced after the cloud, which disappeared when it reached the mountain.

10
00:00:43.285 --> 00:00:45.846
soon arrived at the mountain and found a cave.

11
00:00:47.326 --> 00:00:49.647
Its door was closed.

12
00:00:50.368 --> 00:00:51.728
pounded on the cave door.

13
00:00:51.748 --> 00:00:53.029
"Open up!"

14
00:00:53.189 --> 00:00:53.669
he yelled.

15
00:00:54.589 --> 00:00:57.190
The door flew open, and the woman came out.

16
00:00:58.591 --> 00:00:59.011
are you?"

17
00:00:59.371 --> 00:01:00.552
demanded the woman.

18
00:01:01.296 --> 00:01:02.917
"Why are you pounding on my door?"

19
00:01:02.998 --> 00:01:05.199
"Release our master!"

20
00:01:05.520 --> 00:01:07.821
shouted Wukong, ignoring her questions.

21
00:01:08.662 --> 00:01:09.423
woman laughed.

22
00:01:10.383 --> 00:01:12.485
"Don't tell me what to do!"

23
00:01:16.528 --> 00:01:17.449
The monkey attacked.

24
00:01:19.751 --> 00:01:25.015
The woman spun around fast, blocking his iron bar and striking back with fury.

25
00:01:25.035 --> 00:01:26.917
"You shouldn't have come here!"

26
00:01:27.097 --> 00:01:28.538
she shouted as she fought.

27
00:01:28.558 --> 00:01:30.780
"Even Buddha is afraid of me!"

28
00:01:32.396 --> 00:01:35.198
Bajie tried to hit her with his rake but missed.

29
00:01:36.398 --> 00:01:39.100
The woman was now spinning faster and faster.

30
00:01:39.120 --> 00:01:41.681
"She's faster than a tornado!"

31
00:01:41.941 --> 00:01:42.682
cried the pig.

32
00:01:44.062 --> 00:01:44.883
leaped at the woman.

33
00:01:45.563 --> 00:01:48.084
Suddenly he felt a stabbing pain.

34
00:01:49.505 --> 00:01:52.367
"Ahh!" cried the monkey, grabbing his head.

35
00:01:53.087 --> 00:01:54.628
hurts! It hurts!"

36
00:01:56.089 --> 00:01:57.409
He ran down the mountain.

37
00:01:58.690 --> 00:02:01.892
Bajie and Wujing stared after Wukong in shock.

38
00:02:03.148 --> 00:02:05.050
The woman went back into her cave.

39
00:02:05.070 --> 00:02:08.512
"What happened to Wukong?"

40
00:02:08.872 --> 00:02:09.573
asked the pig.

41
00:02:10.454 --> 00:02:13.196
"Nothing hurts him except for the Tight Headband spell."

42
00:02:13.216 --> 00:02:17.499
"I don't know," said Wujing, scratching his head.

43
00:02:19.821 --> 00:02:23.703
They went down the mountain and found the monkey crouching by a stream.

44
00:02:24.884 --> 00:02:26.626
He was still holding his head.

45
00:02:26.646 --> 00:02:28.167
"Are you all right?"

46
00:02:28.507 --> 00:02:30.524
asked Wujing.

47
00:02:30.744 --> 00:02:33.886
woman stabbed me in the head," moaned Wukong.

48
00:02:33.906 --> 00:02:36.708
"The pain is horrible!"

49
00:02:41.390 --> 00:02:44.892
snorted. "You're always bragging about how tough you are.

50
00:02:45.752 --> 00:02:48.454
Now you're crying about getting stabbed in the head?"

51
00:02:49.414 --> 00:02:50.535
"It hurts!"

52
00:02:50.975 --> 00:02:51.816
shouted the monkey.

53
00:02:53.056 --> 00:02:53.917
moved closer.

54
00:02:53.937 --> 00:02:55.598
"Let me see where she stabbed you."

55
00:02:56.878 --> 00:02:57.859
lowered his hands.

56
00:02:58.359 --> 00:03:01.088
There was no injury.

57
00:03:01.649 --> 00:03:03.629
laughed. "He's fine.

58
00:03:04.290 --> 00:03:06.391
He just wants us to feel bad for him."

59
00:03:07.451 --> 00:03:08.872
monkey glared at the pig.

60
00:03:08.892 --> 00:03:11.433
"I'm telling you, it hurts!"

61
00:03:14.314 --> 00:03:15.254
took a deep breath.

62
00:03:16.175 --> 00:03:17.895
"The pain is going away now though.

63
00:03:19.576 --> 00:03:21.297
Let's go back up there and fight her again."

64
00:03:23.438 --> 00:03:25.879
The three companions returned to the cave.

65
00:03:25.899 --> 00:03:32.007
"Wukong, you stand back," said Bajie, laughing.

66
00:03:32.027 --> 00:03:35.169
"I don't want you getting hurt again."

67
00:03:37.271 --> 00:03:39.092
Wukong clenched his teeth.

68
00:03:41.394 --> 00:03:43.036
pig hit the door with his rake.

69
00:03:44.917 --> 00:03:46.098
The door exploded.

70
00:03:47.359 --> 00:03:48.660
woman ran outside.

71
00:03:48.680 --> 00:03:50.822
"You smashed my door!"

72
00:03:51.102 --> 00:03:51.723
she shouted.

73
00:03:52.784 --> 00:03:54.005
"Release our master!"

74
00:03:54.285 --> 00:03:55.086
shouted the pig.

75
00:03:55.106 --> 00:03:57.848
"Or we'll smash your entire mountain!"

76
00:04:00.053 --> 00:04:02.695
The woman spun around, faster and faster.

77
00:04:03.475 --> 00:04:06.497
Bajie and Wujing tried to strike her with their weapons.

78
00:04:07.338 --> 00:04:08.879
But the woman was too fast.

79
00:04:09.780 --> 00:04:14.063
Wukong raised his iron bar, waiting for a good moment to strike.

80
00:04:15.544 --> 00:04:18.786
Suddenly Bajie cried out, "Ahh!"

81
00:04:19.527 --> 00:04:22.649
He covered his nose and ran back down the mountain.

82
00:04:24.710 --> 00:04:27.736
The woman spun toward Wukong and Wujing.

83
00:04:27.756 --> 00:04:30.398
They turned and ran back down the mountain.

84
00:04:32.500 --> 00:04:36.323
Bajie was huddled on the ground, tears streaming from his eyes.

85
00:04:36.343 --> 00:04:40.066
"It hurts so badly!"

86
00:04:44.090 --> 00:04:47.273
laughed. laugh at me!"

87
00:04:47.533 --> 00:04:48.373
cried Bajie.

88
00:04:48.393 --> 00:04:51.416
"She stabbed my nose!"

89
00:04:53.398 --> 00:04:55.019
"You deserved it!"

90
00:04:55.199 --> 00:04:55.860
said the monkey.

91
00:04:56.672 --> 00:04:58.433
"You didn't believe me when I got hurt."

92
00:05:00.373 --> 00:05:02.094
arguing," said Wujing.

93
00:05:02.114 --> 00:05:04.595
"We still have to save the Tang Monk."

94
00:05:05.675 --> 00:05:07.596
"You're right," said Wukong.

95
00:05:08.256 --> 00:05:09.136
"Let's go back up there."

96
00:05:10.056 --> 00:05:11.537
voice called out, "Wait!"

97
00:05:13.337 --> 00:05:14.158
It was Guanyin.

98
00:05:15.078 --> 00:05:17.439
The bodhisattva was walking toward the group.

99
00:05:17.459 --> 00:05:20.700
"Beware of that scorpion spirit!"
